; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Sierpinski Triangle
; CATEGORY: Fractals
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     recursion, triangle, fractal, FILLED
; SUMMARY:  Paints the Sierpinski triangle from three half sized copies of itself.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   A triangle is made of three smaller triangles, one in each
;   corner, with a hole in the middle. Each of those is made the same
;   way. At the bottom of the recursion the turtle paints a solid
;   little triangle, colored by where it sits on the screen.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Change the depth on the last line (0 to 7).
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * recursion with three calls
;   * FILLED to paint a shape the turtle walks around
;   * moving with the pen up between the corners
;   * using XCOR to choose a color
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Try depth 0, 1, 2 and 3 to see how the pattern is built.
;   * Make the small triangles all one color.
;   * Leave out the third recursive call. What is left?
; ============================================================

; SOLID paints one triangle of side :size. The turtle starts at the
; bottom left corner facing right, and ends there too.
to solid :size
  ; The further right the triangle, the more red; the further left,
  ; the more blue. XCOR runs from about -300 to 300.
  localmake "red 128 + xcor * 0.4
  filled (list :red 90 255 - :red) [
    repeat 3 [forward :size left 120]
  ]
end

; SIERPINSKI walks the same path as SOLID, but at each corner it
; draws a half sized Sierpinski triangle instead of painting.
to sierpinski :size :depth
  if :depth = 0 [solid :size stop]
  repeat 3 [
    sierpinski :size / 2 :depth - 1
    ; Slide along the edge to the next corner, without drawing.
    penup forward :size left 120 pendown
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [250 250 245]
; The bottom left corner, facing right (heading 90). A triangle with
; side 560 is about 485 tall, so starting at y = -250 centers it.
penup setxy -280 -250 setheading 90 pendown
setpencolor [40 40 60]
sierpinski 560 6
